@unnumberedsec Installation

Please see the file named @file{INSTALL} for detailed instructions on
building and installing Gamma from its source distribution.

@unnumberedsec Distribution Contents

This distribution includes the following, among others:

@table @file

@item src/
C++ source files for Gamma

@item db/
C source files for Gamma Debugger

@item doc/
Input files and support programs for building documentation.  Apart
from files in this directory, documentation is also extracted from
comments in source code.

@item scheme/
@itemx lua/
Front end language library code.  This is the outer layer of the
libraries exported by Gamma to the front end languages.  The core of
the libraries is implemented in C++.

@end table
@bye
